<noinclude>
Stores a customer as SMW properties (Tt name/contact/notes). Created and edited via [[Form:Customer]]. The page title
is a stable random id; the name is a field (shown via <code>DISPLAYTITLE</code>), so a customer can be renamed without
moving the page.
[[Category:Time tracker templates]]
</noinclude><includeonly>{{#default_form:Customer}}{{#set:
|Tt name={{{name|}}}
|Tt contact={{{contact|}}}
|Tt notes={{{notes|}}}
}}{{DISPLAYTITLE:{{{name|{{PAGENAME}}}}}}}{{#if:{{{contact|}}}{{{notes|}}}|<div class="tt-card tt-entity">
<div class="tt-facts">
{{#if:{{{contact|}}}|<div class="tt-fact"><span class="tt-fact-label">Contact</span><span class="tt-fact-value">{{{contact}}}</span></div>|}}
</div>{{#if:{{{notes|}}}|<div class="tt-desc">{{{notes}}}</div>|}}
</div>|}}
<h2 class="tt-section">📁 Jobs</h2>
<div class="tt-jobs-row">{{#timetracker_tile:newjob|{{FULLPAGENAME}}}}{{#timetracker_jobs:{{FULLPAGENAME}}}}</div>
<h2 class="tt-section">⏱️ Timesheet</h2>
{{#timetracker_grid:customer|{{FULLPAGENAME}}}}
[[Category:Customers]]
</includeonly>
